<title>FRANCE: Breakdown of EU grain export/import balance.</title>
<headline>Breakdown of EU grain export/import balance.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are details of EU grain export/import commitments as of March 18 in the July-to-June 1996/97 campaign, supplied by member country officials.</p>
<p>On March 20, the EU also granted exports of 480,000 tonnes of soft wheat, 294,000 tonnes of barley, 6,000 tonnes of rye and 3,000 tonnes of oats.</p>
<p>Figures below ('000 tonnes) are based on officially communicated certificates and are subject to revision.</p>
<p>			 ---------1996/97-------  ------1995/96-----</p>
<p>			    1Jul96 to 18Mar97	1Jul95 to 18Mar96</p>
